{"nodes": [{"id": "brand_platform_03", "label": "Brand Platform \u2014 Fairy Flame (Phase 3)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "fairy_flame_product", "label": "Fairy Flame (microdose gummy product)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "the_glow", "label": "The Glow (brand world)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Chosen over The Clearing and Firefly Hour because it is restoration made visible: a state (her own light relit), not a destination or daypart. A glow is inherently witnessed by family, converting the dataset's most powerful emotional structure (identity loss witnessed by family) into the brand's core mechanic, and the existing gold-on-indigo glow tokens render it with zero visual retrofit. Guardrail: glow means inner light returning, never skin/beauty glow.", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "firefly_hour", "label": "Firefly Hour (evening ritual moment / Territory 3)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Rejected as master brand world because it is a daypart and her problem is all-day; kept as a room inside the Glow \u2014 the 8pm wine-glass-replacement ritual \u2014 because it plants a flag on moment ownership, the category white space nobody holds.", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "third_door_mechanism", "label": "The Third Door (not a push, not a numb)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Mechanism framing built from VoC: coffee pushes a tired brain harder, wine/pills numb it \u2014 the microdose is a third thing, a reset. Answers Schwartz Stage 3-4 sophistication where calm/focus claims are exhausted; validates her failed-solution history ('it was never my fault, the tools were wrong').", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "forty_five_day_arc", "label": "The 45-Day Return Arc (phased results timeline)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Days 1-7 lighter mornings, 8-21 baseline reset, 22-45 clarity holds, 45+ lock-in. Does expectation-setting work against the category's #1 kill-shot ('felt nothing') by framing week-one subtlety as design, quietly justifies the 3-pouch default (90 gummies \u2248 the full arc), and structures the email flow and upsell logic.", "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "brand_platform_03", "target": "avatar_research_01", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brand_platform_03", "target": "category_analysis_02", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brand_platform_03", "target": "the_glow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "autoVSL/research/fairy-flame/brand/03-brand-platform.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brand_platform_03", "target": "firefly_hour", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confide